{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"- (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"update","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use this method to update the appearance of the user location annotation. This","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"method is called by the associated map view when it has determined that the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"user location annotation needs to be updated. This can happen in response to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"user interaction, a change in the user’s location, when the user tracking mode","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"changes, or when the viewport changes.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"During user interaction with the map, this method may be called many","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"times to update the user location annotation. Therefore, your implementation of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this method should be as lightweight as possible to avoid negatively affecting","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"performance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","name":"Note","type":"aside"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"update","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNUserLocationAnnotationView(im)update","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"update","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"update","role":"symbol"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentati